  <text xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0402.elenes_mnesteres.kock1884-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><body n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0402.elenes_mnesteres.kock1884-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0402.elenes_mnesteres.kock1884-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0402_elenes_mnesteres"><head>ΕΛΕΝΗΣ ΜΝΗΣΤΗΡΕΣ</head><div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="73" xml:id="kock-0402-elenes_mnesteres-73" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0402_elenes_mnesteres">
              <lg>
                <l n="1" xml:id="kock-0402-elenes_mnesteres-73-l1" xml:lang="grc">οὐδὲ ῥόαν γλυκεῖαν ἐκ τῆς δεξιᾶς</l>
                <l n="2" xml:id="kock-0402-elenes_mnesteres-73-l2" xml:lang="grc">δέξαιτ’ ἂν αὐτῶν.</l>
              </lg>
              <note type="source">Athenaeus 14, 650 e Ἄλεξις Μνηστῆρσιν· ῥόαν γὰρ ἐκ τῆς χειρὸς αὐτῶν. Apostol. 13, 16 b (Arsen.) οὐδὲ ῥόαν γλυκεῖαν ἐκ τῆς δεξιᾶς δέξαιτο ἄν· ἤγουν παρὰ πονηρῶν οὐδὲ χρηστὰ λαμβάνειν.</note>
              <note type="apparatus">unde quod supra scripsimus effinxit Leutschius, nisi quod οὐδ’ ἂν ῥόαν posuit, nulla necessitate. cf. Theophr. H. pl. 2, 2, 5. C. pl. 1, 9, 2. Schneid. Theophr. V 496 (Leutsch. Philol. I 159).</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="74" xml:id="kock-0402-elenes_mnesteres-74" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0402_elenes_mnesteres">
              <p>εἷς ἕκαστος</p>
              <note type="source">Ἄλεξις Ἑλένης μνηστῆρσιν. Bekker. Anecd. 96, 10.</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="75" xml:id="kock-0402-elenes_mnesteres-75" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0402_elenes_mnesteres">
              <p>θερμολουτεῖν</p>
              <note type="source">Ἄλεξις Ἑλένης μνηστῆρσιν. Bekker. Anecd. 99, 20. cf. Hermipp. 76.</note>
